Package: askfirst
Title: Detect and Redirect LLM/AI-Agent Callers
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("ropensci-review-tools", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "maintainers@ropensci-review-tools.example")
Description: Lets R package maintainers detect when their package's
    functions are being called by an LLM/AI coding agent rather than a
    human, and issue a message redirecting the agent to tell the human
    user to contact the maintainer directly instead of silently working
    around a bug or missing capability. Detection data is vendored from
    the language-agnostic 'vercel/detect-agent' specification.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    cli,
    jsonlite,
    rlang
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
